{"id":"HK-TM","duration":209.51,"segments":[{"a":0,"b":6.58,"o":0},{"a":7.03,"b":18.36,"o":6.58},{"a":18.79,"b":23.34,"o":17.91},{"a":33.36,"b":37.14,"o":22.46},{"a":37.41,"b":53.64,"o":26.24},{"a":54.15,"b":61.1,"o":42.47},{"a":62.21,"b":65.64,"o":49.42},{"a":66.73,"b":69.64,"o":52.85},{"a":69.93,"b":73.28,"o":55.76},{"a":73.67,"b":79.2,"o":59.11},{"a":79.91,"b":85.86,"o":64.64},{"a":86.51,"b":90.72,"o":70.59},{"a":91.33,"b":99.74,"o":74.8},{"a":100.13,"b":118.38,"o":83.21},{"a":118.85,"b":122.88,"o":101.46},{"a":123.29,"b":141.48,"o":105.49},{"a":141.81,"b":144.06,"o":123.68},{"a":144.39,"b":157.08,"o":125.93},{"a":157.41,"b":174.76,"o":138.62},{"a":175.31,"b":184.54,"o":155.97},{"a":185.29,"b":192.5,"o":165.2},{"a":193.39,"b":198.16,"o":172.41},{"a":199.01,"b":205.34,"o":177.18},{"a":206.15,"b":210.66,"o":183.51},{"a":211.47,"b":225.58,"o":188.02},{"a":226.45,"b":230.82,"o":202.13},{"a":231.15,"b":234.16,"o":206.5}],"lines":[{"id":"L01","sec":"open","text":"Imagine you can win the league — and the opponent standing in your way is Real Madrid.","s":0,"e":6.4},{"id":"L02","sec":"open","text":"That's exactly what happened on May 10th, 2026.","s":6.73,"e":11.99},{"id":"L03","sec":"open","text":"And for the first time in the club's history, Barça clinched the title by beating Madrid.","s":12.51,"e":17.73},{"id":"L04","sec":"open","text":"Let me take you through that night — and the season that led to it.","s":18.06,"e":22.14},{"id":"L05","sec":"road","text":"The season had already given Barça one win over Madrid.","s":22.68,"e":26.06},{"id":"L06","sec":"road","text":"In January, in Jeddah, they won the Spanish Super Cup final three–two, with two goals from Raphinha.","s":26.39,"e":33.85},{"id":"L07","sec":"road","text":"In the semi-final, they had beaten Athletic Club five–nil.","s":33.85,"e":38.53},{"id":"L08","sec":"road","text":"It was a statement: this team could hurt anyone.","s":38.53,"e":42.29},{"id":"L09","sec":"road","text":"But the spring was hard.","s":42.62,"e":44.28},{"id":"L10","sec":"road","text":"Atlético Madrid knocked them out of the Copa del Rey semi-finals — and then out of the Champions League quarter-finals too.","s":44.28,"e":52.55},{"id":"L11","sec":"road","text":"The cup exit was especially painful.","s":52.55,"e":55.58},{"id":"L12","sec":"road","text":"Barça lost the first leg four–nil in Madrid — and then won the second leg three–nil at home.","s":55.91,"e":62.1},{"id":"L13","sec":"road","text":"One goal short.","s":62.1,"e":64.46},{"id":"L14","sec":"road","text":"And in April came the worst news of all.","s":64.79,"e":67.51},{"id":"L15","sec":"road","text":"Lamine Yamal tore his hamstring.","s":68.09,"e":70.41},{"id":"L16","sec":"road","text":"The best player in the league was out for the rest of the season.","s":70.74,"e":74.62},{"id":"L17","sec":"road","text":"So when Real Madrid came to the Camp Nou in May, Barça needed a win to make the title theirs — without their star.","s":74.95,"e":84.82},{"id":"L18","sec":"match","text":"It took Barça just a few minutes to show they weren't nervous.","s":85.42,"e":88.36},{"id":"L19","sec":"match","text":"Marcus Rashford, on loan from Manchester United, stood over a free-kick — and scored it directly.","s":88.72,"e":95.16},{"id":"L20","sec":"match","text":"One–nil.","s":95.16,"e":96.54},{"id":"L21","sec":"match","text":"Then Ferran Torres made it two.","s":96.54,"e":99.28},{"id":"L22","sec":"match","text":"Both goals came in the first eighteen minutes.","s":99.28,"e":101.28},{"id":"L23","sec":"match","text":"Madrid had more than an hour to come back.","s":101.61,"e":105.31},{"id":"L24","sec":"match","text":"They never found a way.","s":105.64,"e":106.84},{"id":"L25","sec":"match","text":"And at the final whistle, it was two–nil.","s":107.14,"e":109.85},{"id":"L26","sec":"match","text":"Barça were champions of Spain — for the second season in a row.","s":109.85,"e":114.8},{"id":"L27","sec":"history","text":"It was the club's twenty-ninth league title.","s":115.14,"e":117.74},{"id":"L28","sec":"history","text":"But this one felt different.","s":118.12,"e":119.82},{"id":"L29","sec":"history","text":"Barça had won leagues against Madrid before, and beaten them in the title races.","s":119.82,"e":125.75},{"id":"L30","sec":"history","text":"But they had never clinched a title by beating them, in the same game.","s":126.08,"e":130.68},{"id":"L31","sec":"history","text":"Until that night.","s":130.68,"e":132.82},{"id":"L32","sec":"numbers","text":"By the end of the season, Barça had ninety-four points — eight more than Real Madrid.","s":132.96,"e":138.44},{"id":"L33","sec":"numbers","text":"And they won every single league game at home.","s":138.77,"e":141.81},{"id":"L34","sec":"numbers","text":"Nineteen out of nineteen.","s":141.81,"e":143.87},{"id":"L35","sec":"numbers","text":"Lamine Yamal finished as the team's top scorer with twenty-four goals in all competitions, and was named La Liga's player of the season — even though he missed the final weeks.","s":143.87,"e":155.79},{"id":"L36","sec":"numbers","text":"And the team scored ninety-five league goals, more than anyone else in Spain.","s":156.12,"e":161.76},{"id":"L37","sec":"numbers","text":"Raphinha, Ferran Torres, Fermín López — the goals came from everywhere.","s":161.76,"e":166.79},{"id":"L38","sec":"verdict","text":"It wasn't the perfect season.","s":167.29,"e":168.61},{"id":"L39","sec":"verdict","text":"Atlético beat them twice when it mattered, and the Champions League is still the trophy this team wants most.","s":168.61,"e":177},{"id":"L40","sec":"verdict","text":"But in the league, against Madrid, when it counted — this team delivered.","s":177.33,"e":181.87},{"id":"L41","sec":"twist","text":"And here's the twist.","s":182.53,"e":183.33},{"id":"L42","sec":"twist","text":"Two of the men who scored that night are already gone.","s":183.66,"e":187.84},{"id":"L43","sec":"twist","text":"Rashford went back to England, and Ferran Torres — after scoring the winner in the World Cup final — was sold to Paris Saint-Germain.","s":188.17,"e":198.83},{"id":"L44","sec":"twist","text":"So the question for this season is simple:","s":198.83,"e":201.95},{"id":"L45","sec":"twist","text":"Can the new Barça finally go all the way in Europe?","s":202.28,"e":206.32},{"id":"L46","sec":"twist","text":"Tell me what you think in the comments.","s":206.65,"e":208.61}],"words":[{"w":"Imagine","line":"L01","s":0,"e":1.04},{"w":"you","line":"L01","s":1.04,"e":1.52},{"w":"can","line":"L01","s":1.52,"e":1.76},{"w":"win","line":"L01","s":1.76,"e":2.02},{"w":"the","line":"L01","s":2.02,"e":2.24},{"w":"league","line":"L01","s":2.24,"e":2.48},{"w":"and","line":"L01","s":2.48,"e":3},{"w":"the","line":"L01","s":3,"e":3.14},{"w":"opponent","line":"L01","s":3.14,"e":3.5},{"w":"standing","line":"L01","s":3.5,"e":3.94},{"w":"in","line":"L01","s":3.94,"e":4.3},{"w":"your","line":"L01","s":4.3,"e":4.46},{"w":"way","line":"L01","s":4.46,"e":4.84},{"w":"is","line":"L01","s":4.84,"e":5.56},{"w":"Real","line":"L01","s":5.56,"e":6.02},{"w":"Madrid.","line":"L01","s":6.02,"e":6.4},{"w":"That's","line":"L02","s":6.73,"e":7.23},{"w":"exactly","line":"L02","s":7.23,"e":7.71},{"w":"what","line":"L02","s":7.71,"e":8.15},{"w":"happened","line":"L02","s":8.15,"e":8.55},{"w":"on","line":"L02","s":8.55,"e":8.87},{"w":"May","line":"L02","s":8.87,"e":9.17},{"w":"10th,","line":"L02","s":9.17,"e":10.05},{"w":"2026.","line":"L02","s":10.41,"e":11.99},{"w":"And","line":"L03","s":12.51,"e":13.13},{"w":"for","line":"L03","s":13.13,"e":13.31},{"w":"the","line":"L03","s":13.31,"e":13.47},{"w":"first","line":"L03","s":13.47,"e":13.73},{"w":"time","line":"L03","s":13.73,"e":14.05},{"w":"in","line":"L03","s":14.05,"e":14.25},{"w":"the","line":"L03","s":14.25,"e":14.37},{"w":"club's","line":"L03","s":14.37,"e":14.77},{"w":"history,","line":"L03","s":14.77,"e":15.01},{"w":"Barça","line":"L03","s":15.01,"e":15.6},{"w":"clinched","line":"L03","s":15.6,"e":16.19},{"w":"the","line":"L03","s":16.19,"e"